+*   **Ray Generation:** For pixel $(u, v)$, a random lens offset `rd` is sampled from a unit disk [S5, unofficial]. The direction is `LowerLeftCorner + Horizontal*u + Vertical*v - Origin - offset` [S5, unofficial].
